{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cyber Rats is a brutal rogue-lite survival horror game</h2></strong>You are a rat trapped in a sinister, AI-controlled test facility. In deadly mazes, horrifying experiments are conducted on helpless rats every day. Can you complete the objectives of the maze, and escape with your life intact? Can you stop the evil AI, and save the lives of yourself and your fellow lab rats?<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Death is part of the experiment</h2></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565080/extras/Steam_Gif_8.gif?t=1742572400\" /><strong> </strong>\u2022 You are a lab rat trapped in a nightmarish AI-controlled facility, where every corner hides a gruesome death.  <br>  <br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Procedural generated death maze</h2></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565080/extras/Steam_Gif_10.gif?t=1742572400\" />      \u2022 A constantly shifting labyrinth. Procedural generation ensures\u00a0no maze is ever the same, and you never know, what will be hiding in the shadows.  <br>  <br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nowhere to hide</h2></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565080/extras/Steam_Gif_3.gif?t=1742572400\" /> \u2022 Find the cheese. Avoid the traps. Outsmart the Cyborg Hunters. Survive the maze\u2026 or become another failed experiment.  <br>  <br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade your rats, and unlock new colours and rat types</h2></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565080/extras/Steam_Gif_9.gif?t=1742572400\" /> \u2022 Unlock twisted new rat experiments, zombie rats, cyborgs rats, mutants, and more!   <br>\u2022 Upgrade, evolve, survive. Give your rats the edge they need to escape the AI\u2019s deadly experiments!  <br>   <br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Can you find the way out of this sinister place?</h2></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565080/extras/Steam_Gif_5.gif?t=1742572400\" />\u2022 Every rat matters. Every death counts. Survive the horrors, and break free from the AI\u2019s twisted experiment!  <br>  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565080?t=1742572400","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565080/d30c98ba3d08aa74cd050837e62539dc0ff49682/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742572400","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565080/49dca3637fdf9d39aba04bd1339b5ba68972b438/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742572400","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565080/49dca3637fdf9d39aba04bd1339b5ba68972b438/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742572400","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cyber Rats is a brutal rogue-lite survival horror game</h2></strong>You are a rat trapped in a sinister, AI-controlled test facility. In deadly mazes, horrifying experiments are conducted on helpless rats every day. Can you complete the objectives of the maze, and escape with your life intact? Can you stop the evil AI, and save the lives of yourself and your fellow lab rats?<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Death is part of the experiment</h2></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565080/extras/Steam_Gif_8.gif?t=1742572400\" /><strong> </strong>\u2022 You are a lab rat trapped in 